        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "for-varrock:182bbu4",
          "html": "Take Silverlight from the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Altar_(Demon_Slayer)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">altar</a>. Make sure you actually take the Silverlight in the rock in the centre of the room or you will not be able to do the next steps.",
          "text": "Take Silverlight from the altar. Make sure you actually take the Silverlight in the rock in the centre of the room or you will not be able to do the next steps.",
