          "text": "Read the scroll to the north of the trapdoor.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "for-varrock:dq5psl",
          "html": "Head south to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Aubury%27s_Rune_Shop\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Aubury&#39;s Rune Shop</a>. South of the shop is a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Trapdoor_(Zamorakian_Crypt)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">trapdoor</a> just outside the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Temple_of_Zamorak\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Zamorak temple</a>. Climb down the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Trapdoor_(Zamorakian_Crypt)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">trapdoor</a>.",
          "text": "Head south to Aubury's Rune Shop. South of the shop is a trapdoor just outside the Zamorak temple. Climb down the trapdoor.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "for-varrock:1j0xf52",
